nt:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT berkata:</h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6acf7218-8474-83ec-8606-c198f53d311f" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="a836e197-4d66-4491-911c-6a24cd77d7ed"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_e5_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="a836e197-4d66-4491-911c-6a24cd77d7ed" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-inline-reveal="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="a836e197-4d66-4491-911c-6a24cd77d7ed"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Untuk menambahkan <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Dashboard Penulis Komik</span> ke website Lentera Aksara yang sudah ada di GitHub, kamu cukup memperbarui <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">3 file utama</span> dari ZIP versi perbaikan. Tidak perlu mengganti semua folder proyek.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">1. File yang perlu diperbarui</h2><div class="TableFrame-YxtDrz" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-component="table"><table class="Table-QT1UX2" data-d-column-sizing="auto" data-d-dividers="" style="table-layout: auto;"><tbody><tr data-d-component="table-row"><th data-d-align="end" data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">No.</p></th><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">File di proyek GitHub</p></th><th data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start" scope="col"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Tindakan</p></th></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-align="end" data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">1</p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">frontend/src/App.jsx</code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Ganti dengan file versi perbaikan</p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-align="end" data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">2</p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">frontend/src/author.jsx</code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Ganti dengan file versi perbaikan</p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-align="end" data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">3</p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">DEPLOY.md</code></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Opsional, perbarui panduan deployment</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Dua file pertama merupakan perubahan utama untuk menambahkan menu dan halaman dashboard komik.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">2. Cara menggantinya di GitHub</h2><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="start" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" data-d-justify="center" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); flex-shrink: 0; height: 36px; width: 36px;"><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">1</h3></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Ekstrak ZIP versi perbaikan</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Buka folder <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">lentera-aksara-v2-dashboard-komik</code>, lalu masuk ke <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">frontend</code> → <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">src</code>.</p></div></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="start" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" data-d-justify="center" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); flex-shrink: 0; height: 36px; width: 36px;"><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">2</h3></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Buka repository GitHub</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Masuk ke repository Lentera Aksara, buka <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">frontend/src</code>, kemudian pilih <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">App.jsx</code>.</p></div></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="start" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" data-d-justify="center" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); flex-shrink: 0; height: 36px; width: 36px;"><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">3</h3></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Ganti kedua file</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Unggah versi baru <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">App.jsx</code> dan <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">author.jsx</code>, masing-masing ke lokasi yang sama. Pastikan nama file dan huruf besar-kecilnya tetap sama.</p></div></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="start" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-align="center" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-width="" data-d-has-height="" data-d-justify="center" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); flex-shrink: 0; height: 36px; width: 36px;"><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">4</h3></div><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Simpan perubahan</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Klik <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Commit changes</span>. Jika Vercel terhubung ke repository dan branch tersebut, deployment biasanya berjalan otomatis.</p></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">3. Apakah backend dan database perlu diubah?</h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Untuk perubahan menu dan tampilan dashboard, fokusnya adalah dua file frontend di atas. Namun, fitur unggah halaman komik dan penyimpanan episode mungkin memerlukan migrasi database serta dukungan backend. Jangan menganggap semua fitur tersebut sudah berfungsi hanya karena menunya muncul.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Saran saya:</span> sebelum mengganti file, buat salinan atau branch cadangan dari proyek yang sekarang agar mudah dikembalikan jika terjadi error.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center sel