}</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="group/scroll-to-bottom cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Gulir ke bagian paling bawah" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC text-default" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#arrow-down-lg-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">3. <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">DEPLOY.md</code></h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Ganti isi <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">DEPLOY.md</code> dengan panduan berikut. File ini membantu kamu mengatur database, backend, frontend, dan fitur komik saat website diterbitkan.</p><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#code-light-20" fill="