"color: inherit; width: max-content;"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted" style="color: inherit;">diperbaiki</span><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" data-rtl-flip="" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path d="M16.2256 6.99994C16.6534 7 17 7.34654 17 7.77436V14.817C17 15.2449 16.6534 15.5914 16.2256 15.5915C15.7977 15.5915 15.4512 15.2449 15.4512 14.817V9.6437L8.32182 16.773C8.0193 17.0756 7.52944 17.0755 7.2269 16.773C6.92437 16.4705 6.92437 15.9807 7.2269 15.6781L14.3562 8.54878H9.1829C8.75505 8.54878 8.40848 8.20221 8.40848 7.77436C8.40848 7.34651 8.75505 6.99994 9.1829 6.99994H16.2256Z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Perbaikan yang dilakukan:</p><ul class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Memperjelas konfigurasi database MySQL Aiven.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Merapikan environment variables untuk backend Render dan frontend Vercel.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Menambahkan panduan menghubungkan frontend dengan backend.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Menambahkan checklist khusus fitur dashboard penulis komik.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Menambahkan pemeriksaan API episode, unggah gambar, autentikasi, dan penyimpanan file.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Menambahkan langkah troubleshooting jika deployment gagal.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Memperjelas bahwa nama variabel dan perintah harus cocok dengan kode backend yang sebenarnya.</p></div></div></li></ul><h3 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Cara mengganti file di GitHub</h3><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Unduh file hasil perbaikan di atas.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Buka repository GitHub Lentera Aksara.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Buka file <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">DEPLOY.md</code> di folder utama repository.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Klik ikon pensil <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Edit this file</span>, atau unggah file pengganti dengan nama <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">DEPLOY.md</code>.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Simpan dengan <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Commit changes</span>.</p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Catatan:</span> file ini memperbaiki dokumentasi deployment, bukan kode backend atau database. Fitur komik tetap memerlukan API dan tabel database yang sesuai agar bisa berfungsi.</p></div></div></div></div><div><span class="inline-flex align-middle"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default bg-text/5 not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-text/10 data-[state=open]:bg-text/10 border-transparent flex size-5 items-center justify-center p-0" aria-label="Lihat analisis"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#code-light-16" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></span></div></div><div class="mt-3 w-full max-w-120"><div class="flex max-w-[min(100%,var(--resource-card-max-width,100%))] flex-col overflow-hidden font-sans text-default [--resource-card-row-padding-x:0.75rem] rounded-2xl border border-default bg-surface-elevated [--resource-card-row-padding-x:1rem]"><div id="_r_fm_" class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-border-subtle"><span class="group/resource-row relative"><button aria-busy="false" aria-label="Buka pratinjau DEPLOY-Lentera-Aksara-diperbaiki.md" class="absolute inset-0 cursor-interaction bg-transparent hover:bg-text/5 focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-inset disabled:cursor-wait" type="button"></button><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center text-start relative gap-3 py-3 pe-14 ps-[var(--resource-card-row-pad