xt-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Berikut </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">prompt </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">sampul </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">website </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Lentera </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Aksara</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">yang </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">bisa </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">kamu </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">gunakan </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">di </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">AI </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">pembuat </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">gambar </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">atau </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">AI </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">pembuat </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">desain </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">website. </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Saya </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">buat </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">dengan </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">konsep </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">elegan, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">modern, </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">dan </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">cocok </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">untuk </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">platform </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">baca </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">novel </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">serta </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">komik </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">digital.</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Prompt </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">sampul </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">utama </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Lentera </span><span data-d-text-flow="word" data-d-stream-word="">Aksara</span></h2><div><div class="group/writing-block-surface relative isolate w-full min-w-0 overflow-clip rounded-[var(--oai-wb-radius)] [box-shadow:var(--oai-wb-shadow)] [color:var(--oai-wb-text-primary)] [contain:inline-size] [font-family:var(--oai-wb-font-sans)] frame-aD2tvA editorControls-fA0_fZ clear-both my-4 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:my-0 in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overflow-y-auto in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:overscroll-contain in-data-[avatar-overlay-orbit-transcript]:scrollbar-none [--wb-surface-primary:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-surface-elevated-secondary)_86%,var(--color-surface))] [--wb-accent:var(--codex-base-accent,var(--color-text-info,var(--color-text)))] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--color-background-primary-ghost-hover)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--color-text-info-solid,var(--color-text-inverse,#fff))] [--wb-selection:var(--color-background-text-selection)] [--wb-font-size:var(--codex-chat-font-size,0.875rem)]" data-oai-writing-block-surface="" data-markdown-copy="rich-block" data-markdown-copy-text="Buat desain sampul hero (homepage cover/banner) website bernama **Lentera Aksara**, sebuah platform digital untuk membaca, menemukan, dan menerbitkan novel serta komik.

**Konsep desain:** perpaduan dunia sastra yang elegan dengan imajinasi fantasi modern. Gunakan warna utama maroon gelap, krem hangat, dan aksen emas yang mewah. Tampilkan sebuah buku terbuka yang memancarkan cahaya keemasan, dengan halaman-halaman yang berubah menjadi bintang, partikel cahaya, dan ilustrasi dunia fantasi. Tambahkan siluet menara kastel, langit malam berbintang, bunga-bunga halus, serta elemen ilustrasi komik dan novel yang menyatu secara artistik.

**Komposisi:** letakkan judul “Lentera Aksara” sebagai fokus utama dengan tipografi serif elegan, mudah dibaca, dan berwarna krem atau emas. Tambahkan slogan persis: **“Terangi Imajinasi, Hidupkan Cerita.”** Gunakan komposisi sinematik dengan pencahayaan dramatis, detail halus, kedalaman visual, dan ruang kosong yang cukup agar teks tidak bertabrakan dengan ilustrasi.

**Nuansa:** hangat, magis, nyaman untuk membaca, eksklusif, kreatif, dan mengundang pengunjung menjelajahi berbagai cerita. Desain harus terlihat seperti branding platform literasi digital profesional, bukan poster film atau sampul satu novel.

**Kebutuhan website:** format horizontal 16:9, resolusi tinggi, cocok untuk hero banner homepage desktop dan mudah diadaptasi ke tampilan mobile. Pastikan judul dan slogan terbaca jelas, tidak terpotong, tidak ada teks acak, tidak ada watermark, dan tidak menggunakan logo atau karakter berhak cipta milik pihak lain." data-testid="chatgpt-writing-block" data-writing-block-variant="standard" style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-back